  "cost_semantics": "pinned session: total_cost_usd of the turn's last result event is cumulative over the session (observed only when every result event of the turn is the pinned session's); a turn's cost is its increase over the previous observed turn; after an unobserved turn the next increase is an unassigned interval, not that turn's cost; the run's pinned-session cost is the last cumulative value. Reviewer calls and user-proxy consultations are fresh sessions (their total_cost_usd is the call's cost). Unobserved values stay null, never 0.",
